DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T113000
UID:260828STwAxdXbiEyQ_YKqmfFvBg
DESCRIPTION:Wondering how to landscape in a way that is climate-resilient\
 , beautiful\, and builds habitat?\n\nJoin us for a FREE  Fire & Water-W
 ise Landscaping Workshop with Jennifer Roberts of the Resilient Landscap
 es Coalition\n\nWhether you're looking to: comply with state/county fire r
 egulations\, protect where you live\, garden with less water\, learn about
  native plants\, better utilize rain and stormwater\, build habitat... thi
 s workshop can help!\n\nWe'll cover \n\n-Fire-wise Design: Best practices
  & Defensible Space\n\n-Water-Wise Design: Swales\, Rain Tanks\, & Rain g
 ardens\n\n-Native & Climate Appropriate Plant Selection\n\n-Landscaping De
 sign and Maintenance
LOCATION:Cavanagh Center (Mentor Me)
URL:https://secure.qgiv.com/for/jcwzbq/event/firewaterwiselandscaping2026/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
