DESCRIPTION:Sonoma Ecology Center’s annual Harvest Festival is a joyful\
 , family-friendly gathering that brings our community together in one of S
 onoma’s most beloved green spaces. The Harvest Festival is held at Sonom
 a Garden Park\, a community garden and public oasis just a few minutes fro
 m downtown Sonoma\, stewarded by Sonoma Ecology Center. The festival featu
 res a full day of local music\, hands-on workshops\, kid-friendly activiti
 es and farm games\, delicious local food and beverages\, a pickle-making c
 ompetition\, and immersive nature experiences for all ages.
