DESCRIPTION:Spanish Family Storytime Join us for Spanish Family Storytime 
 at the Roseland Library. Learn and practice early literacy skills with you
 r child. We will have fun reading\, singing\, and moving together. This pr
 ogram is designed for families with children ages 0 to 5. Storytime is fro
 m 11:30-12pm Stay and play with other families! from 12-12:30pm
LOCATION:Roseland Regional Library
