DESCRIPTION:Treat yourself to a fun afternoon in our outdoor garden creati
 ng your very own masterpiece with local artist/instructor\, Jena Webber. S
 he will guide you through\, step-by-step\, as you create your own personal
 ized "Mosaic Pumpkin" just in time for the fall season. Unwind and celebra
 te a beautiful day with special friends while letting your creative juices
  flow\, sipping some wine\, listening to great music and enjoying an after
 noon under the shade trees.\n\nWhile working on your mosaic\, enjoy music 
 by Don Gato performing 1-4pm. \\*Music included with Mosaic Pumpkin admiss
 ion.\n\nYour first glass of wine\, of your choice\, is included with admis
 sion. All art supplies will be provided. Bring your own protective coverin
 g if you'd like. Charcuterie items and other snacks will be available for 
