SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. Adam Lieb
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T180000
UID:260915_ikMTkeTOUaInZUKBvmu4Q
DESCRIPTION:Join us for live music in our tasting room! Reserve your spot 
 for this Saturday Live Music & Tasting Experience\, where exceptional win
 es\, laid-back vibes\, and great live music come together for an unforgett
 able afternoon.\n\n**Featured Band**\n\nAdam Lieb Blending rock\, blues\, 
 soul\, and global folk influences\, singer-songwriter and guitarist Adam 
 Lieb delivers music infused with passion\, craftsmanship\, and deep cultu
 ral roots. A Brooklyn native now based in Northern California\, Adam’s d
 ynamic performances — whether solo or with his Disorderly House Band —
  showcase a lifetime of musical exploration\, from touring with Robert Fri
 pp’s League of Crafty Guitarists to recording at Abbey Road Studios.\n\n
 **Details**\n\nWalk-ins are welcome\, but priority seating is given to win
 e club members and guests with reservations. This event tends to fill up q
 uickly\, so we highly recommend making a reservation to secure your table.
  No outside food is allowed\, but we are dog and family friendly. For larg
 e groups of 13 or more\, please email us at visit@spicyvines.com.
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/events/live-music-by-adam-lieb-16/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
