 nspiring live experience complete with show stopping renditions of Fleetwo
 od Mac's greatest hits. Audience participation is encouraged\, and bay are
 a crowds are coming in droves to sing along with Fleetwood Macramé. What'
 s more\, they sound so much like Fleetwood Mac\, if you closed your eyes y
 ou would think it was the real thing. Only it's better\, because you are f
 ront row!
