UID:761739da13241a186365520043c9422c@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Cindy's Race 2026\, a community event dedicated to
  raising awareness about the increasing rate of breast cancer diagnoses in
  young women and mothers while celebrating hope\, resilience\, and action.
  Participants can run\, walk\, or take part in the family-friendly race wh
 ile learning about early detection\, self-breast awareness\, and the impor
 tance of wellness and healthy living. More than a race\, this event brings
  together survivors\, families\, friends\, and advocates to honor those im
 pacte
