SUMMARY:Step Into Wonder - The Letting Go Art Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T160000
UID:260930eO8dFOg9a0mBNg9yTV6hXQ
DESCRIPTION:An all-ages community art experience where visitors are invite
 d to paint\, draw\, explore\, and add their marks to collaborative artwork
 s that will continue to evolve throughout the month. Come once or return e
 ach Sunday to see how the galleries change as the community creates togeth
 er.\n\nWonder Sundays are free\, all-ages afternoons inside Step Into Wond
 er: The Letting Go Art Experience—an immersive\, evolving world of glowi
 ng sculpture\, music\, creative play\, and collaborative art.\n\nYou won
 ’t simply look at the art. You’ll become part of it.\n\nExplore the in
 stallations\, respond to creative prompts\, add your own marks to the gall
 ery\, move\, play\, reflect\, and follow your curiosity. Each Sunday\, vis
 itors will contribute something new\, allowing the space to grow and trans
 form throughout the month.\n\nNo artistic experience is needed\, and there
  is no right or wrong way to participate. Come as you are\, stay for as lo
 ng as you like\, and give yourself permission to create freely.
LOCATION:Mare Island Art Studios
URL:https://thelettinggoartexperience.com/all-events/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
