 materials. Whether you're a novice or a seasoned crafter\, this workshop o
 ffers a warm and welcoming environment for all skill levels.\n\nSilvia Bag
 nacani is a professional artist\, educator\, and floral designer with a pa
 ssion for celebrating the beauty of seasonal blooms. Known around Sonoma f
