DESCRIPTION:The CHANDON Rocks and Ribs Oyster Fest is an epic afternoon\, 
 the ultimate garden bash\, where sparkling wine meets fresh-shucked oyster
 s and smoky ribs hot off the grill. Tickets include half a dozen fresh Hog
  Island oysters\, perfectly paired with three CHANDON sparkling cuvées\, 
 and St. Louis-style ribs fresh off the grill with all the fixings. This is
  CHANDON at its most festive: outdoors\, indulgent\, and unmistakably Cali
 fornian. A 21\\+ garden bash that celebrates the season's final act in the
  grandest way possible. Best for: food lovers and wine enthusiasts seeking
  a memorable\, celebratory garden event — a bold\, joyful afternoon pair
 ing CHANDON sparkling wines with exceptional food in a beautiful Napa Vall
 ey setting.
LOCATION:CHANDON
URL:https://www.chandon.com/en-us/visit-us/WineryExperience-Details-Oyster
 Fest.html
