DESCRIPTION:Join St. Francis Winery for the annual  Blessing of the Animal
 s \, a family- and pet-friendly fundraiser in Sonoma County. Bring dogs\, 
 cats\, reptiles\, fish\, and all your beloved companions for an afternoon 
 celebrating the bond between humans and animals. The event supports the Hu
 mane Society of Sonoma County and local animal rescues\, reflecting St. Fr
 ancis Winery's commitment to giving back. Admission is free\, and donation
 s are welcome\, with pre-purchase packages available in July 2026. The eve
 nt is held at St. Francis Winery & Vineyards\, 100 Pythian Rd\, Santa Rosa
 \, CA. Reservations are encouraged for a smooth experience for all attende
 es and their furry\, scaly\, or aquatic friends.
LOCATION:St. Francis Winery & Vineyards
