ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/SOUNDCHECK-POSTER-8_20_2026-2.png
GEO:38.2751233;-122.4255305
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=DESCRIPTION:  \nAt Gundlach Bundschu we’ve always believed that the best memories happen after the bottle is opened. This October we’re bringing that spirit to life in a new way – and you’re officially invited! \nJoin us on Sunday October 4th for the inaugural Soundcheck a brand-new daytime live music event. For one afternoon we’re transforming the Rhinefarm into an immersive concert experience with live music at our Amphitheater stage DJ sets local food trucks wine tasting experiences and plenty to discover between performances. \nThis year’s concert will feature Tropa Magica Spacemoth & Christina’s Trip. Soundcheck is all about discovering new music in an unforgettable setting – and you may just leave with a new favorite band… \nReserve your spot today and help us kick off what we hope becomes a favorite tradition for years to come. \nDATE: Sunday October 4th 2026 \nTIME: 2-7p \n Gundlach Bundschu Winery (Amphitheater Courtyard & Arbor Bar) \nTICKETS: Gundlach Bundschu or Abbot’s Passage Club member price $35. Public $55pp. Guests under 10 are free to attend. \nBUY TICKETS;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2000 Denmark St:geo:-122.4255305,38.2751233
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.cloverdaleperformingarts.com/events/tales-of-expense-3-classic-radio-dramas-live-on-stage"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Tales of Suspense - 3 Classic Radio Dramas Live on Stage
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T160000
UID:260821AQglQT4cAE-19dLN5w_5-w
DESCRIPTION:Step back into the Golden Age of Radio as Cloverdale Performin
 g Arts Center presents three unforgettable tales of mystery and suspense\,
  performed live with voice actors\, sound effects\, and music created befo
 re your eyes.\n\nThe Monkey's Paw tells the chilling story of a mysterious
  talisman that grants three wishes—but at a terrible cost. A timeless su
 pernatural thriller that reminds us to be careful what we wish for.\n\nThe
  House in Cypress Canyon follows a newlywed couple whose dream home become
 s the setting for an unexplainable and terrifying mystery. As strange even
 ts unfold\, the line between reality and nightmare begins to blur.\n\nThe 
 Maltese Falcon\, adapted from the classic detective story\, plunges audien
 ces into a world of deception\, danger\, and intrigue as private investiga
 tor Sam Spade searches for a priceless treasure while navigating a web of 
 unforgettable characters.\n\nJoin us for an evening of classic radio drama
  where every sound sparks the imagination and every story keeps you on the
  edge of your seat.
LOCATION:Cloverdale Performing Arts Center
URL:https://www.cloverdaleperformingarts.com/events/tales-of-expense-3-cla
 ssic-radio-dramas-live-on-stage
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
