DESCRIPTION:In his talk and presentation\, &ldquo\;We Are One\,&rdquo\; Br
 yan Keith Thomas explores and celebrates the rich cultural heritage of the
  Black South. Drawing on themes of ancestry\, spirituality\, and collectiv
 e memory\, Thomas uses symbols such as cotton\, roses\, and church fans to
  evoke the emotional and cultural landscapes that shape identity.
