UID:260923P5pKk9Y9ek6QXQi5M4EqHw
DESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in the world of fine wine at the Culinary Ins
 titute of America at Greystone in St. Helena\, CA\, on **October 6\,** for
  an exclusive event featuring acclaimed wine writer Jancis Robinson and ex
 pert Alder Yarrow. Attendees will enjoy a captivating live discussion on t
 he future of global viticulture\, climate change\, and the release of the 
 brand-new edition of *The World Atlas of Wine*. The afternoon concludes wi
 th an exclusive book signing and celebratory reception tailored for true w
 ine connoisseurs.
LOCATION:The Culinary Institute of America at Greystone
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/the-world-atlas-of-wine-book-event-and-si
 gning-with-jancis-robinson-tickets-2000524020197?keep_tld=true
