  Black girls and young women to connect\, uplift\, and empower one another
 .</p><p>  Through sisterhood\, conversation\, wellness\, education\, leade
 rship\, and creative experiences\, students can build meaningful relations
 hips while growing personally and academically.</p><p>  Topics and activit
 ies may include:</p><ul><li>Sisterhood &amp\; community  </li><li>Self-lov
 e and confidence  </li><li>Academic &amp\; career success  </li><li>Wellne
 ss and life skills  </li><li>Leadership and personal growth  </li><li>Cult
