DESCRIPTION:Vallejo Heritage Neighborhood Celebrates!!!!\n\nWe’re joinin
 g thousands of neighborhoods across the United States to celebrate Nationa
 l Night Out. Bringing neighbors\, community\, businesses\, and local gover
 nment together to get to know one another and to:\n\n• Strengthen neighb
 orhood spirit and community partnerships.\n\n• Heighten crime and drug p
 revention awareness.\n\n• Generate support for\, and participation in\, 
 local anti crime programs.\n\nCome out and send a message to criminals let
 ting them know that our neighborhood is organized and fighting back! We’
 ll have Food\, Fun and Activities\, and live music. The Imaginarium Engine
 ers at Obtainium Works will be on hand with their imaginative art cars\, c
 ontraptions\, and general fun gadgets.\n\n• Bring a Dish to Share\n\n•
  Burgers and Hot Dogs available.\n\n• Community and neighborhood busines
 s booths\n\nBring a folding chair or camping chair to catch a seat at the 
 neighborhood Community Dining table.
