SUMMARY:Vista Neighborhood National Night Out
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T200000
UID:261001_m0rgT9r90iGrgrLFusDRQ
DESCRIPTION:National Night Out is a free community event designed to build
  police community partnerships. It is an opportunity to bring neighbors\, 
 organizations\, businesses\, and community leaders together.\n\nFor those 
 who have never been to a NNO\, the event is open to Vista residents. We ge
 t a permit to close the street. We invite everyone to bring their own chai
 r \\(and a table if desired\\)\, and some kind of dinner item or dessert o
 r beverage to share. We will provide name tags\, tables for shared items\,
  table cloths\, server ware\, water\, cups\, plates\, forks/spoons\, and n
 apkins. We also will have some sidewalk chalk for kids big and small to en
 courage some fun drawing in the street\, along with some crayons and color
 ing sheets for kids. Come visit. It's a nice way to meet neighbors and for
 ge community. ABSOLUTELY NO SMOKING\, VAPING\, OR PETS. And if the CDC say
 s to wear masks\, do it\; else it's up to you. And please be kind to walke
 rs and drive 25 mph or less in the neighborhood on the way there! Walk if 
 you can to the location to leave room for parking for those who need it mo
 st due to mobility issues.\n\nNOTE: This is a nation wide event\, so other
  neighborhoods in Vallejo also will have them\, as will other towns all ov
 er the place!
LOCATION:Vista Neighborhood
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/4433488716891024/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
