DESCRIPTION:SPOOKTACULAR SOUNDS\n\n🎃 Halloween is coming early! 🎃\n\
 nBreak out your Halloween costume early and join us for SPOOKTACULAR SOUND
 S as we kick off spooky season!\n\nEnjoy the Solano College Chamber Orches
 tra and Solano College Chamber Choir as they present a selection of spooky
  tunes.\n\nBetween songs\, enjoy the teachings of professors Teri Yumae an
 d Michael Reilly as they provide background and insights on the music\, co
 mposers\, and performers you’ll see and hear!\n\nBONUS! You’ll get a s
 pecial treat \\(no tricks!\\) just for attending… it is Halloween after 
 all!\n\nTuesday\, October 6 at 7 p.m.\n\nAbout 1.5 hours\n\nFREE entry and
  parking!\n\nSolano College Theatre\n\nBuilding 1200\n\n4000 Suisun Valley
  Road\n\nFairfield\, CA 94534\n\nAbout the producer: Solano College Music 
 is dedicated to educating the next generations of musicians\, singers\, an
 d composers in the performance and development of great music! We produce 
 concerts that contribute meaningfully to the culture\, education\, and ent
 ertainment of our Solano County community.
LOCATION:Solano College Theatre
