BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/hip-hop-teen-class-ages-12-18/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Hip Hop Teens Class\, ages 12-18
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T170000
UID:260915NkzgSEhD0ka94yFAPw4kjA
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to bring the energy\, bring the attitude\, and hit t
 he stage! Our Hip Hop Teens class is a high-octane space designed for 12 t
 o 18-year-olds to master authentic street styles\, sharp choreography\, an
 d expressive freestyle dance. Dancers will sharpen their rhythm\, build st
 amina and coordination\, and elevate their self-confidence while leveling 
 up their movement to the freshest\, age-appropriate tracks.\n\n• DATE: O
 CTOBER 7\n\n• TIME: 4:00 PM\n\nWe break down complex\, trending choreogr
 aphy into clear\, actionable steps that challenge and inspire. Your teen w
 ill master core hip-hop foundations\, build quick muscle memory for intric
 ate routines\, and develop the confidence to express their unique style an
 d individuality through movement.\n\n• Dynamic Warm-Ups: High-energy phy
 sical conditioning\, dynamic stretches\, and rhythm drills to build stamin
 a and prime the body for movement.\n\n• Technique & Skill Building: Leve
 ling up classic and contemporary hip-hop foundations\, sharp isolations\, 
 footwork precision\, and musicality.\n\n• The Routine: A high-octane cho
 reography combination that pushes creative expression\, performance qualit
 y\, and stage presence.\n\n• Freestyle Cypher: An empowering\, supportiv
 e space at the end of class for teens to unlock their personal style\, imp
 rovise\, and hype each other up.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin 4140 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/hip-hop-teen-class-ages-12-18/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108643271?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=287&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Callie Watts
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T160000
UID:260820stPGzxTM0UWlyqOdmyvYPQ
DESCRIPTION:Callie Watts is a singer/songwriter from Northern California w
 ho was raised on classical music\, The Beatles and The Beach Boys before d
 iscovering Joni Mitchell\, Elton John\, Stevie Wonder\, Paul Simon\, Billy
  Joel\, Carole King\, and all the great writers of the ’60s and 70’s w
 ho have influenced her sound and writing style. After graduating high scho
 ol\, Callie began playing and performing solo\, as well as in local and ba
 y area bands of different genres. She’s played blues with Eric Lindell a
 nd the Reds\, funky soul with Phatty\, and jazz/swing with Savoy Swingers 
 along with many other various projects. Callie has taken turns throughout 
 her career as a keyboardist\, guitarist\, writer\, and lead/backing vocali
 st\, and she’s currently a member of the dynamic Sonoma County funk rock
  band Burrows and Dilbeck\, having joined in 2010 as part of the former ba
 nd Frobeck. Over time\, she’s had the honor of opening for acts such as 
 Bootsy Collins\, Elvin Bishop\, Huey Lewis and The News\, War\, Ozomatli\,
  Bill Champlin\, Booker T\, and the B52s. Callie continues to perform freq
 uently as an acoustic solo artist\, focusing on developing a core audience
  and a buzz for her original material. Come hang out and listen at venues 
 such as Aroma Roasters\, Rincon Valley Tap Room and Bottle Shop\, and Hopm
 onk Tavern.
LOCATION:Farmstead at Long Meadow Ranch
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108643271?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
