UID:260915vJn5yLTtS0yI4YpP7hjXww
DESCRIPTION:*Emilia* by Morgan Lloyd Malcolm is a passionate\, feminist r
 eimagining of the life of 17th-century poet and musician Emilia Bassano. T
 he play\, performed by an all-female cast\, delves into her journey from a
  privileged childhood\, to becoming a trailblazing poet\, and a woman figh
 ting for her say in a male-dominated world.
LOCATION:SRJC Burbank Auditorium
URL:https://srjc.universitytickets.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/summer-film-series-at-the-madrona/2026-10-07/", "Press Democrat": "https://themadronahotel.com/summer-film-series/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/summer-film-series-at-the-madrona/2026-10-07/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Summer Film Series at The Madrona
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T210000
UID:260625FosjXAn9wEGoG7PGU8y7rg
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy unforgettable summer evenings at The Madrona's Summer Fi
 lm Series\, an outdoor cinema experience presented in partnership with Tru
 e West Film Center and local winery partners. Held on the first Wednesday 
 of each month through October\, the series transforms the historic hillsid
 e estate into a scenic open-air theater overlooking Sonoma wine country. G
 uests can relax on the lawn at golden hour with a complimentary glass of l
 ocal wine before settling in for a featured film. Admission includes popco
 rn\, a snack\, personal headphones\, cozy seating\, and blankets for a com
 fortable viewing experience. The 2026 lineup features beloved favorites\, 
 including A League of Their Own\, Clueless\, Back to the Future\, and an a
 udience-choice finale. Combining classic films\, local wines\, and stunnin
 g surroundings\, this unique event offers the perfect way to spend a summe
 r evening in Healdsburg.
LOCATION:Madrona Manor
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/summer-film-series-at-the-madrona/2026-10
 -07/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
