SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050425Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T201500
SUMMARY:Nurturing Good Choices
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\nWe're faced with c
 hoices everyday. Can becoming more aware of the choices we make help us re
 spond to life in a more harmonious and uplifting way? **The choice is ours
 .**\n\n"We *are* a state of consciousness. Everyone and everything in our 
 personal life and universal world has an effect upon us. We want to become
  aware of what these effects are. Then we can sort through them\, nurturin
 g the good ones and discarding the bad."— Harold Klemp *[The Loving Hear
 t](https://www.amazon.com/Loving-Heart-Immortality-Soul-ebook/dp/B0CBNMP8J
 Z/ref=ast_sto_dp_puis "https://www.amazon.com/Loving-Heart-Immortality-Sou
 l-ebook/dp/B0CBNMP8JZ/ref=ast_sto_dp_puis")\,* p. 100\n\nBy tapping into o
 ur own inner resource\, Divine Spirit\, we can learn to:\n\n* **Nurture** 
 better choices\n* **Move through** challenging events with Grace\n* **Rais
 e** our state of consciousness\n\nJoin this spiritual exploration about wh
 at to nurture and what to discard in our lives — with choices that come 
 up everyday or once in a lifetime.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/the-santa-rosa-spiritual-experiences-
 group/events/316715442/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260925T212802Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260925T212802Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
