SUMMARY:Protect Your Website from ADA Claims Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T110000
UID:2a935f308bf2e4d738c47021131dfc41@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:From Compliance to Confidence: Protecting Your Website from AD
 A Claims Is your business website accessible to everyone and could it leav
 e you vulnerable to an ADA claim? Join us for a free\, informative worksho
 p designed to help small businesses better understand web accessibility an
 d take practical steps toward a more accessible online presence. Petaluma-
 based web accessibility expert Justin Landskron\, founder of QnC\, will sh
 are insights from more than 30 years of experience in web design\, accessi
 bility\, and AI\, including extensive ADA/CCPA remediation work. Attendees
  will learn what ADA web accessibility means\, the difference between full
  and partial compliance\, how to evaluate a website using free tools\, and
  how to develop an accessibility statement. Whether you're just beginning 
 to think about accessibility or want to better understand your current lev
 el of compliance\, this workshop will provide useful information and pract
 ical guidance you can take back to your business.
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/protect-your-websi
 te-from-ada-claims-workshop
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
