 f you love to sing\, we want YOU! ✨ All voices are welcome! We are esp
 ecially looking for tenors and basses singers.\n\n**September 3rd is the F
 irst Rehearsal o**f the Fall/Winter session. Arrive by 6:45pm to register
  - Rehearsals are every Thursday.  Winter Concert on December 13th.  Hav
