 education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle between opposing camps\, 
 but of intentional design.  Generative systems offer novel capabilities fo
 r research\, creation\, and learning\, yet their ultimate value depends en
 tirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.Andrew Sniderman is a retired Mic
 rosoft executive teaching AI tools to the next generation.Learn more on th
 e SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks website. (https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-ta
 lks-2026)
