DESCRIPTION:Join us for a rocking good time at Penngrove Pub on Friday\, 1
 0/9 from 7-10 PM!\n\nIn addition to upbeat original rock\, we'll be perfor
 ming tasty versions of classic hits you know and love from the 60s-80s plu
 s a very special tribute set in celebration of John Lennon's birthday!\n\n
 The lineup for this live performance features band founder and songwriter\
 , Jason E Davies \\(lead vocals\, lead/rhythm guitar\\)\, Travis Thayer \\
 (sax/keys/vocals\\)\, Rob Neidel \\(bass/vocals\\)\, and Chris Oatman \\(d
 rums\\).\n\nWhether you enjoy melodic vocals\, searing guitar and sax solo
