BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.reusealliance.org/events/novato-repair-fair-2026"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Novato Repair Fair & Halloween Swap
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T130000
UID:260921RSX7qJc6pk6IeKtXWzSotg
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a lamp\, small appliance\, textile\, or bike in ne
 ed of repair?\n\nBring it to the Repair Fair!‍ ‍\n\nVolunteers and spe
 cialized repair professionals will be on-hand to repair\\* your items.  
 We ask that you stay with your item while it's being fixed\, so you can le
 arn tips for future maintenance\, how to shop for repairable goods\, and e
 ven how to repair things yourself!  \n\nIf you’d like to bring an it
 em to repair\, please register the item here: https://www.reusealliance.or
 g/rf-reg\n\n\\(Pre-registering allows us to prepare for your item!\\)\n\nT
 his event will also feature a Halloween Costume & Decor Swap! Spooky Seaso
 n is around the corner - bring in your used costumes\, props\, and decor \
 \(must be clean and in good condition\\)\, and take home items that are ne
 w-to-you!\n\nThis is a free public event.\n\n\\*We cannot guarantee your i
 tem\\(s\\) will be repaired\, depending on the existing damage or breakage
 \, ability of volunteer fixers\, and availability of materials for repair.
  Note: we cannot work on microwaves\, repair screens on cell phones/comput
 er devices\, or perform any welding/brazing\, but we are happy to refer y
 ou to professionals who can. In addition\, the textile department is not a
 ble to perform the following:\n\nReplacing zippers\n\nRepairing shoes\, le
 ather\, or vinyl materials\n\nPerforming alterations \\(making garments bi
 gger/smaller\\)\n\nReplacing rivets/grommets\n\nHemming certain fabrics \\
 (stretchy fabric\, sleek/luxury fabrics e.g. prom dresses\\)\n\nIf you are
  in need of garment hemming\, we require that you please pin your garment 
 to the desired length before you arrive.\n\nJoin Us!\n\nDoes fixing things
  sound like a fun way to spend a Saturday afternoon?  Or want to help out
  in other ways?  We need you! Sign up here: https://www.reusealliance.org
 /rf-volunteer\n\n or email volunteer@reusealliance.org if you have any que
 stions.
LOCATION:Novato City Hall
URL:https://www.reusealliance.org/events/novato-repair-fair-2026
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
