DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T150000
UID:260715rwJXP5gTKECZIuUhMoyWJA
DESCRIPTION:with Margarita Loinaz\n\nBeyond the confines of the conceptual
  mind\, life unfolds in a continuous flow that is unobstructed\, pervasive
 \, fresh\, and constantly revealing. The discursive mind with its strong p
 references interrupts this flow and disconnects us from the Earth\, each o
 ther\, and the greater cosmos. Through meditations with movement\, stillne
 ss\, and inquiry\, we will explore ways to recognize non-conceptual awaren
 ess\, noticing the shifts in perception that allow the flow of connection 
 to re-establish itself.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/opening-to-the-flow-of
 -connection-at-the-heart-of-life-mz1d26/?lang=en
