SUMMARY:Floating Pumpkin Patch at Hamilton Pool
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T120000
UID:260906DOgfuwELUE-Ywzgu7sA0Yg
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that pumpkins float?!? Come splash and share the 
 Hamilton Pool with pumpkins on Saturday\, October 10 from 12pm - 2pm. Each
  ticket includes entry to the pool\, a pumpkin\, & pumpkin decorating mate
 rials. Pre-registration is required by 10/7. Registration is required by a
 ll to enter and there will be no drop-ins for this event. Every single per
 son attending must be registered\, including all children and guardians/pa
 rents. For example\, if a family of 4 plans to attend\, all 4 individuals 
 need tickets. Per pool policy\, children under 16 cannot enter without adu
 lt supervision. Please keep this in mind when registering your party. Ther
 e will also be complementary games and activities outside the pool if you 
 prefer to stay dry! The Event will run rain or shine\, and tickets are non
 -refundable. \\*Pool ONLY OPEN for event attendees.
LOCATION:Hamilton Community Pool
URL:https://www.marinmommies.com/calendar/floating-pumpkin-patch-hamilton-
 pool
