DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T160000
UID:260902EFAUr-oTH0OO7i9f3tMBFg
DESCRIPTION:Fragments of Time and Places Featuring Teresa Saluzzo\n\nSatur
 day\, October 10 | 1–4 p.m. Fulton Crossing | 1200 River Road\, Fulton\n
 \nOur memories are gathered over time in fragments—moments\, emotions\, 
 places\, and impressions that settle into layers.\n\nJoin us for an aftern
 oon of art\, conversation\, and discovery as we celebrate Teresa Saluzzo a
 nd her latest exhibition\, Fragments of Time and Places.\n\nWander through
  more than 10\,000 square feet of artist studios\, explore the work of 20 
 local artists\, and enjoy the chance to meet the people behind the art.\n\
 nThere will be live music\, sips and bites\, and plenty of inspiration alo
 ng the way.\n\nCome spend the afternoon with us!
LOCATION:Fulton Crossing
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1589616922795557/
