BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/petaluma-river-upstream-high-tide-paddle/18032819/2026-10-10T13"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Petaluma River Upstream High Tide Paddle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T150000
UID:260211XRnt3RmHHEi2cF1EYyozxQ
DESCRIPTION:When the tide is high\, the Petaluma River opens into a quiete
 r\, greener world.\n\nJoin The Floathouse crew at their central downtown d
 ock for a gentle\, guided paddle upstream\, timed to higher tides that all
 ow access beyond the downtown channel and into a tranquil tidal slough. Wi
 th extra water beneath us\, we’re able to glide into calm\, lush stretch
 es of the river that are normally out of reach.\n\nThis unhurried paddle h
 ighlights the natural beauty of the Petaluma River’s brackish\, tidal wa
 terway. Watch for great egrets\, blue herons\, snowy egrets\, turtles bask
 ing along the banks\, and abundant plant life. The calm water and peaceful
  surroundings create a deeply grounding experience—many guests say they 
 feel their stress melt away within minutes.\n\nAlong the way\, knowledgeab
 le guides share stories of the river’s ecology and human history\, offer
 ing insight into how this upper channel has shaped—and continues to shap
 e—Petaluma. It’s a rare opportunity to experience how close wild natur
 e lives to the heart of downtown.\n\nBeginner-friendly. Sit-on-top kayaks 
 and all gear provided.
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/petaluma-river-upstream
 -high-tide-paddle/18032819/2026-10-10T13
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/funky-florals-cut-paper-collage-workshop-with-sall?aff=cityspark"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Funky Florals | Cut Paper Collage Workshop with Sally-Ann Langley
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T160000
UID:261001olIlPGHukUmQ0pv-FzDCtw
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to play with color\, pattern\, and shape in this fun
 \, whimsical collage workshop! You'll create your very own Funky Floral ar
 twork using painted papers\, colorful patterns\, and playful floral and le
 af shapes.\n\nYou'll make your own painted collage papers\, add colorful p
 atterns with paint pens\, then get snipping and cutting your flowers and l
 eaves. From there\, you'll experiment with composition and arrange your pi
 eces into a funky floral design that's uniquely yours. Create a 9x11 artwo
 rk or a collection of notecards and gift tags!\n\nThe emphasis is on havin
 g fun and playing with your creativity\, even if you've never created a co
 llage before. Sally-Ann will demonstrate each step and cheer you on along 
 the way.\n\nAbout Sally-Ann:\n\nSally-Ann is a Northern California multidi
 sciplinary artist based in Petaluma\, CA. After working for 20 years as a 
 packaging designer\, she is now a freelance illustrator and licensed artis
 t selling her work online and on products nationwide. Sally-Ann teaches wo
 rkshops in the US and internationally.\n\nwww.slangleyart.com\n\n@sally\\_
 ann\\_langley
LOCATION:Petaluma Arts Center
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/funky-florals-cut-paper-co
 llage-workshop-with-sall?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
