  local businesses\, food\, treats\, oddities\, collectibles & more. This i
 s where the community comes to shop\, explore\, and fully step into spooky
  season. ️ October 10th\, 2026 ⏰ 4PM – 9PM Roseville\, CA Whether yo
 u’re coming to shop small\, bring the family\, find something unique\, o
 r just soak in the Halloween atmosphere… this is your night.  ⚡ Vendor
