DESCRIPTION:Raise a glass at the  Sonoma County Harvest Fair's Tasting Pav
 ilion \, a one-night celebration of award-winning wine\, local food\, and 
 Sonoma County's vibrant wine and culinary community. Sample medal-winning 
 wines from up to 100 established and emerging wineries\, along with delici
 ous bites from local restaurants\, caterers\, and food producers. Guests c
 an dress up for an evening of tasting and celebration while discovering th
 e winners of the Sweepstakes Wines and enjoying culinary creations from th
 e Professional Food Competition. It's a festive opportunity to meet fellow
  wine and food lovers and toast Sonoma County's winemakers and culinary ar
 tists.
