DESCRIPTION:Dive into the art of winemaking with this intimate event that 
 offers a unique peek into our process. Your adventure begins in the stunni
 ng John C. Sullenger vineyard\, where you’ll discover the secrets of gra
 pe growing and\, if conditions allow\, taste grapes straight from the vine
 . Next\, step into our tank room to taste freshly pressed grape juice befo
 re you head to the barrel room for a sip of our wine straight from the bar
 rel. Conclude your experience with a seated tasting of exquisite cabernets
 \, perfectly paired with delicious bites crafted by our talented culinary 
 team. Don’t miss this opportunity to immerse yourself in the heart of ou
 r harvest season!
LOCATION:Nickel & Nickel
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/nickelandnickel/event/609471/grape-to-glas
 s-harvest-experience
