DESCRIPTION:The City of Clearlake and Rotary of Clear Lake are teaming up 
 for an afternoon of fall fun while supporting Rotary’s mission to END PO
 LIO NOW! Sunday\, October 11\, 2026 ⏰ 1:00 PM – 4:00 PM Austin Park | 
 Clearlake\, CA Bring the whole family—including your four-legged family 
 members—and join us for: End Polio Now Torch Relay Dog Costume Parade & 
 Contest Pumpkin Painting for Kids Jumpy House Farmers Market Family-friend
