X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://cantiamosonoma.org/events", "Press Democrat": "https://cantiamosonoma.org/events"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://cantiamosonoma.org/events"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Cantiamo Sonoma Fall Concert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T170000
UID:260916JExsSL0VvUW2Ea4UK7Tusg
DESCRIPTION:Cantiamo Sonoma invites you to an autumn afternoon of a cappel
 la choral music at St. Seraphim of Sarov Orthodox Cathedral\, an acoustica
 lly exquisite and visually inspiring setting.\n\nOur program traces a musi
 cal journey across five centuries\, from luminous Renaissance masterpieces
  to expressive contemporary works that reveal the enduring beauty and powe
 r of the human voice.  Come hear works composed by William Byrd\, Hans L
 eo Hassler\, Claudio Monteverdi\, William Harris\, Benjamin Britten\, Step
 hen Paulus\, Moses Hogan\, Lucy Walker\, and more!\n\nWe hope you will joi
 n us for exceptional music\, warm fellowship\, and a festive outdoor recep
 tion in the cathedral gardens following the performance. Tickets can be pu
 rchased at the door or online via our website.
LOCATION:St. Seraphim Of Sarov Orthodox Church
URL:https://cantiamosonoma.org/events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
