UID:TKF/640bd014795edf4fa3769b14/556/29865210/0/0
DTSTART:20261013T173000Z
DTEND:20261013T200000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/556/1791912600000
SUMMARY: Watercolor Fundamentals Part 1
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Anne Millett\n\nDate: This is a 6-class series\, 
 meeting 6 Tuesdays September 15th\, 22nd\, 29th\, October 6th\, 13th & 20
 th.\n\nTime: 10:30AM-1:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n$270.00\n\nThere
  will be a materials fee of $20 plus tax for the series.\n\n*optional 7th
  and 8th classes priced separately\, October 27th & November 3rd.\n\n\nWa
 tercolor Fundamentals - Part 1\n\nThis class focuses on the simple deligh
 t of mixing color with water\, brushing it on paper\, and watching what h
 appens as it moves and dries. You will learn easy ways to create painting
 s that are all about color and the sometimes unpredictable nature of wate
 r.\n\nNo drawing skills are needed.\n\nIn this class we will explore the 
 basic principles of watercolor painting. Learn or refresh your understand
 ing of brush handling\, brush care and setting up\, the benefits of “good
  paper”\, watercolor lights and darks\, flat and graded washes\, wet-on-w
 et techniques such as charging\, wet-on-dry techniques such as glazing\, 
 color wheel\, color theory\, color mixing\, and more. Simple applications
  of these techniques invite you to experiment and play.\n\nThis class is 
 designed for adults 18+ (exceptions made for very motivated teens\, pleas
 e email to discuss)\n\nclass sizes are limited to 8 people\, please regis
 ter early\n\n$270 for 6 classes\, 2.5 hours each class\n\nThere will be a
  materials fee of $20 plus tax for the series.\n\n*optional 7th and 8th c
 lasses priced separately\nPayable via check\, cash\, or Zelle.\n\n*Brushe
 s\, palettes\, set-ups\, and paint will be provided.*\n\n\nTo see Anne's 
 work and to learn more about this class\, please visit her website at: ww
 w.miraaster.com http://www.miraaster.com/\n\n\nTo register for this works
 hop\, please contact Anne by email at: classes@miraaster.com mailto:class
 es@miraaster.com
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Watercolor
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/640bcf85795edf
 4fa3769ae5/652aed378bbc014a065e4371/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Instructor: Anne Millett Date: This is a 6-class ser
 ies\, meeting 6 Tuesdays September 15th\, 22nd\, 29th\, October 6th\, 13t
 h & 20th. Time: 10:30AM-1:00PM...
LOCATION:Rileystreet Art Supply\,103 Maxwell Ct\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\,
  USA
