SUMMARY:Classic Cinema - Where the Crawdads Sing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T200500
UID:260627fbdhvOgQokCTaVeLZb9-zA
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday\, October 13\, 2026\n\n6:00pm    Doors open 5:30 pm\
 n\nFree entry. Donations greatly appreciated.\n\nConcessions open for purc
 hase.\n\nAssistive listening devices available.\n\n Sponsored by Nancy an
 d Grant Jordan\n\nWhere the Crawdads Sing tells the story of Kya\, a girl 
 who was left alone and grew up by herself in the dangerous marshlands of N
 orth Carolina. For years\, rumors about the "Marsh Girl" scared the people
  of Barkley Cove\, keeping the smart and strong Kya apart from her communi
 ty. When she becomes close to two young men from town\, Kya steps into a n
 ew and surprising world\; but when one of them is found dead\, the communi
 ty quickly blames her as the main suspect. As the case goes on\, it become
 s harder to know what really happened\, threatening to uncover many secret
 s hidden in the marsh.\n\n Released Jul 15\, 2022\n\nDrama\, Mystery & T
 hriller\n\nRuntime 2h 5m\n\nPG-13 \\(Sexual Content\, A Sexual Assault\, S
 ome Violence\\)
LOCATION:Soper-Reese Theatre
URL:http://soperreesetheatre.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
