SUMMARY:EVENT SERIES* Nature as Medicine: Forest Immersion De-Stress Exper
 ience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T133000
UID:260916JXarDdXuV0yF8HJrnYLQeg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a stress-relieving Nature as Medicine session in t
 he SSU Native Plant and Butterfly Garden. Led by Dr. Sarah Murphy\, take a
  moment to enjoy a mellow\, calm and tech-free immersion in nature. Studie
 s on forest immersion experiences like this have demonstrated they decreas
 e stress levels\, anxiety\, and increase mood\, attention\, feelings of co
 nnectedness and well-being\, and even help boost the immune system. We hop
 e the experience will help you feel refreshed\, grounded\, and mentally re
 charged!
LOCATION:Sonoma State University
URL:https://cei.sonoma.edu/nature-as-medicine-experience
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
