X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/dying-to-talk-about-it-community-conversation/19142501/2026-10-15T14", "Press Democrat": "https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/dying-to-talk-about-it-community-conversation/19142501/2026-10-15T14"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/dying-to-talk-about-it-community-conversation/19142501/2026-10-15T14"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Dying to Talk About It Community Conversation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T160000
UID:260611RPi6KFapEEq-fJlK3wTv2w
DESCRIPTION:You already know everything you need to walk in the door.\n\nN
 o preparation. No expertise. No right answers.\n\nDying to Talk About It i
 s a facilitated conversation where neighbors come together to speak honest
 ly about death and dying – what we fear\, what we hope for\, what we’v
 e witnessed\, and what we carry.\n\nWhat you bring to this room matters. Y
 our stories\, your questions\, your silence — all of it has a place here
 . A trained facilitator holds the space so the conversation can go somewhe
 re real.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Senior Center
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/dying-to-talk-about-it-
 community-conversation/19142501/2026-10-15T14
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
