X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/rush-tribute-project26/", "GoLocal Cooperative": "https://golocal.coop/event/an-evening-with-the-rush-tribute-project/", "Visit Santa Rosa": "https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/an-evening-with-the-rush-tribute-project/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/rush-tribute-project26/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:An Evening with the Rush Tribute Project
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T193000
UID:260301yptEXbv9oUOMuC20NdDBHg
DESCRIPTION:Emporium Presents\n\nAn Evening with the Rush Tribute Project\
 n\nThursday\, October 15\, 2026\n\n7:30 pm\n\nBUY TICKETS\n\nThe Rush Trib
 ute Project is an homage to one of the most enduring and influential bands
  in rock music. Combining skilled musicianship with exciting performances\
 , The Rush Tribute Project \\(known as RTP to its dedicated fanbase\\) pai
 nstakingly recreates the sound and energy that made Rush one of the top-se
 lling rock bands of all time. Using vintage instruments\, multi-camera pro
 jection\, state-of-the-art lighting & lasers\, and signature virtuosity\, 
 RTP will be performing two full sets of music\, including Moving Pictures 
 in its entirety\, as well as deep cuts like “La Villa Strangiato” and 
 “Enter Nous.”\n\nHaving performed for more than a decade across North 
 America and around the world\, including RushCon\, RTP stands as one of th
 e premiere tributes to this legendary rock ‘n’ roll power trio.\n\nPla
 tinum Tickets are tickets that are dynamically priced up and down based on
  demand. Platinum Tickets are not part of VIP packages – they are ticket
 s only.\n\nPlatinum Seating provides fans with direct access to securing s
 ome of the best seats in the venue at market value. The market value for P
 latinum Seating is subject to change based on the overall demand and popul
 arity for the event.  Platinum Seating allows fans to purchase tickets in
  a safe and secure environment without running the risk of purchasing tick
 ets that may be considered lost\, stolen\, or counterfeit.\n\nTHIRD PARTY 
 RESELLERS\n\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots 
 to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect
  your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work 
 directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in
  Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily
  accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/rush-tribute-project26/
X-SOURCE:GoLocal Cooperative, North Bay Bohemian, Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://signup.com/go/WiniixA"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Gain Speaking Confidence with Mare Island Toastmasters
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T203000
UID:260916_F-GQWKuFUmPTC2WFNQR9Q
DESCRIPTION:We meet in-person only on the 1st and 2nd Thursdays of the mon
 th. However\, you can catch us online every Thursday unless the meeting da
 te falls on a holiday.\n\nPlease register at https://signup.com/go/WiniixA
 \n\nWhat is Toastmasters About?\n\nUsually at our meetings\, we will have 
 a prepared speech\, and a speech evaluation. The Grammarian and Wizard of 
 Ah's will listen for turns of phrases and the use of filler words. We also
  practice impromptu speaking during the section of the meeting called Tabl
 e Topics. During Table Topics\, at a recent meeting\, we were asked what w
 e felt was the biggest communication problem or challenge. What would you 
 answer in a fast moment? Table topics will challenge you to think quickly 
 and give an answer without preparation.\n\nYou will also hear tips on publ
 ic speaking skills at our upcoming meeting. Whether you're a seasoned trav
 eler or just looking for some adventure from the comfort of your home\, th
 is event is perfect for you.\n\nToastmasters International is all about co
 mmunication excellence\, and for 100 years and counting\, Toastmasters hav
 e been expressing themselves better\, practicing\, and evaluating in a fun
  club environment\, shining all around the world.\n\nTo find out more--Msg
  us on our webpage \\(under Contact Us\\) button at\n\nhttps://mareisland.
 toastmastersclubs.org/\n\nIf you will join us in-person on the first or se
 cond Thursday of the month\, we meet this week at Kaiser Hospital Bldg. A.
  3rd floor meeting room. When you enter the hospital building\, go past th
 e piano to the elevator. Go to the 3rd floor. Exit left out of the elevato
 r and left at the hall. Go past the gym and take a left at the hall. Walk 
 down the long hall to the meeting room.
URL:https://signup.com/go/WiniixA
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
