 e HONOR CHILDREN everywhere. Location is the Graton Community Club\, 8996 
 Graton Road\, Downtown Graton\, CA. Invite your friends\, family and neigh
 bors. Enjoy live music\, plants\, Luncheon\, coffee and desserts\, Raffle 
 prizes\, white elephant gifts\, quilts\, garden art... something for every
