 nd Elizabeth Spencer wines by the glass and bottle will be available for p
 urchase throughout the evening.\n\nVisit the Sanderson Sisters’ Spritz B
 ar and conjure a little Hocus Pocus of your own. Begin with our Black Flam
 e Spritz\, then choose your garden embellishments to complete your potion.
  Mix\, garnish\, and make it your own. Just remember: Amuck! Amuck! Amuck!
