BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.nicheliniwinery.com/product/festa-wine-tasting-2026"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Festa Tasting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
UID:2608288sP0037KUECFQsgbivAf4A
DESCRIPTION:Join us as Nichelini Family Winery celebrates 136 years of win
 emaking heritage!\n\nEnjoy a special anniversary tasting experience\, expl
 ore our historic property\, and take advantage of featured winery specials
  throughout the day. Each tasting includes a commemorative anniversary win
 e glass to take home.\n\nDoors open at 11:00 AM\, with the final tasting b
 eginning at 4:00 PM.\n\nThroughout the day\, guests are invited to join gu
 ided tours of the property led by 4th-generation Nichelini family member P
 inky Dahn\, offering a unique look into the history\, stories\, and tradit
 ions that have shaped Nichelini Winery for more than a century.\n\nWe welc
 ome outside food\, so pack a picnic and relax on the grounds while enjoyin
 g the beauty of Chiles Valley. Wine will be available for purchase by the 
 glass or bottle to enjoy onsite.\n\nFor questions\, please contact us at m
 ail@nicheliniwinery.com.
LOCATION:Nichelini Family Winery
URL:https://www.nicheliniwinery.com/product/festa-wine-tasting-2026
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://cmvineyard.com/visit/", "Press Democrat": "https://cmvineyard.com/visit/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://cmvineyard.com/visit/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T170000
UID:2604305jq-1mdEJUW5z8kOv1543Q
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room 
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://cm.healdsburg.com/events/details/garden-class-with-farmer-mikey-seed-saving-23752"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Garden Class with Farmer Mikey - Seed Saving
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T150000
UID:260306dEgqylmUJUCt2BpzGuoSJA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the end of the growing season by learning the essent
 ial skill of seed saving. Farmer Mikey will share techniques for selecting
 \, drying\, and storing seeds so they can be planted again year after year
 . Guests will leave with seeds collected from the Bricoleur gardens - a li
 ttle piece of the harvest to carry forward. Event Details: Includes: Light
  garden curated lunch by Bricoleur Vineyards Culinary team with two glasse
 s of wine. Timing: 2.5 hour class \\*Please note this will require long pe
 riods of standing and walking on uneven and hard floors. Theme: Learn the 
 how-to&'s of seed saving Availability: Extremely Limited - only 10 seats a
 vailable Club Members: Discount applies at checkout Dress Code: Casual\, c
 losed-toe shoes Dietary Restrictions: We gladly accommodate food allergies
  with advance notice so our guests can dine comfortably and safely. We are
  unable to accommodate personal dietary preferences. Age Requirement: 21\\
 + only Pets: Not permitted at this event
LOCATION:Bricoleur Vineyards
URL:https://cm.healdsburg.com/events/details/garden-class-with-farmer-mike
 y-seed-saving-23752
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
