SUMMARY:Thy Neighbor - Community Movie Screening
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
DTSTAMP:20260924T112317Z
UID:20261017T210000Z-24046@calendar.santarosa.edu
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T140000
ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/src_region/0,0,1563,1563/728_Thy_Neighbor_500px_x_500px.rev.1790273
 588.png
CATEGORIES:Student Clubs Events
DESCRIPTION:This documentary follows Sonoma County's unhoused population a
 nd one of the largest homeless camps in Northern California that resided o
 n the Joe Rodota Trail.  Award winning filmmaker Eliza Hemenway will be sh
 owing the film at two Sonoma County locations prior to its showing at the 
 United Nations Associated Film Festival. One of these showings will be her
 e at our beloved Santa Rosa Junior College and sponsored by the Students f
 or Recovery Club and Homeless Action!&#160\;Thy Neighbor: Community Screen
 ing Tickets - Eventbrite (https://www.eventbrite.com/e/thy-neighbor-commun
 ity-screening-tickets-1999930119825)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924T182317Z
LOCATION:Student Activity Center - Santa Rosa Campus
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/24046-thy-neighbor-community-movi
 e-screening
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  This documentary follows Sonoma County's
  unhoused population and one of the largest homeless camps in Northern Cal
 ifornia that resided on the Joe Rodota Trail.</p><p>  Award winning filmma
 ker Eliza Hemenway will be showing the film at two Sonoma County locations
  prior to its showing at the United Nations Associated Film Festival. One 
 of these showings will be here at our beloved Santa Rosa Junior College an
 d sponsored by the Students for Recovery Club and Homeless Action!&#160\;<
