DESCRIPTION:Join us for a laid-back afternoon in our winery courtyard on S
 aturday\, October 17th!\n\nWe’ll be serving fresh and grilled local Hog 
 Island oysters alongside our Keefer Ranch Blanc de Blancs Sparkling Wine a
 nd Burgundy Series Chablis Premier Cru—the perfect pairings for the seas
 on.\n\nThis intimate gathering is all about slowing down\, savoring the mo
 ment\, and sharing great wine\, food\, and conversation. You’ll have ple
 nty of time to connect with our team and fellow wine lovers.\n\nLet’s ra
 ise a glass together in true Kosta Browne style.
