DESCRIPTION:Free Event | Open to All Prospective String Students\n\nPlease
  join us for our annual Day of Strings at Sonoma State University!\n\nPart
 icipate in masterclasses on standard college admission repertoire\n\nGain 
 insights into how to mentally prepare for auditions from Music and Mindful
