UID:260926Ow6zwxF5DEuPUltMUNlI1A
DESCRIPTION:Mondays Weekly · 8 Weeks\n\nDate & Time\n\nOctober 5 – Nove
 mber 23\, 2026\n\n2:00 PM – 5:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 117\, Ceramics S
 tudio\n\nCategory\n\nCeramics\, Extended Classes\n\nExperience Level\n\nAl
 l Levels\n\nAges\n\n17\\+\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$265\n\nMaterials Fee:\
 n\n$30\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$295\n\nDevelop and improve your thr
 owing skills while exploring a range of forms through multiple class proje
 cts in this all-level throwing class. The instructor guides you through t
 he basic steps of throwing\, shaping\, and trimming of pottery on the whee
 l. This class is a great opportunity for studeto hone basic techniques of
