X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://wl.eventim.us/event/david-nail-down-to-the-studs-or-fully-seated/699442?afflky=MysticTheatre", "Press Democrat": "https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108684109?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=287&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://wl.eventim.us/event/david-nail-down-to-the-studs-or-fully-seated/699442?afflky=MysticTheatre"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:David Nail
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T200000
UID:260913_6TBvkz3AkaQjeGwiRpd0w
DESCRIPTION:Gate 52 Presents:\n\n21+over | https://davidnail.com\n\nExperi
 ence an intimate evening of stories and songs with **David Nail: Down To 
 The Studs**\, a special fully seated performance at the Mystic Theatre. Kn
 own for his powerful voice and deeply personal songwriting\, the Grammy-no
 minated country artist strips everything back for a night that puts the mu
 sic front and center. Fans can expect heartfelt storytelling\, acoustic ar
 rangements\, and the authentic connection that has made David Nail one of 
 country music's most respected singer-songwriters.\n\nFrom chart-topping h
 its like **"Red Light\," "Let It Rain\," "Whatever She's Got\,"** and *
 *"The Sound of a Million Dreams"** to new favorites and behind-the-scenes
  stories from his career\, this one-of-a-kind evening offers a rare chance
  to experience David Nail up close in an intimate setting. **Fully Seated
 ** — reserve your seats early for this special performance.
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://wl.eventim.us/event/david-nail-down-to-the-studs-or-fully-seat
