X-SOURCE:Gundlach Bundschu Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T193000
DTSTAMP:20261002T204537
CREATED:20260929T161029Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929T161029Z
UID:26543-1792605600-1792783800@www.gunbun.com
SUMMARY:Wine Dinner at Hamilton Urban Steakhouse (St. Louis)
DESCRIPTION:Spectacular Spectacular: A Wine Dinner with Jeff Bundschu\nWednesday\, October 21 \nWe’re bringing a little Sonoma to the table. Join Jeff Bundschu for an evening of great food\, Gundlach Bundschu wines\, and stories from six generations on Rhinefarm. \nChef Trevor is putting beef tenderloin in the spotlight with four thoughtfully paired courses plus an amuse-bouche\, inspired by the flavors of Northern California. From tenderloin tartare to seared medallions\, each dish brings something different to the table alongside our Chardonnay\, Tempranillo\, Mountain Cuvée\, and Cabernet Sauvignon. \nPull up a chair\, share a glass with Jeff\, and settle in for a delicious evening. \n$139 per person\, including wine pairings. Tax and gratuity additional. \nReserve Your Table
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/hamilton-wine-dinner-2/
CATEGORIES:Wine Dinner,GB on the Road,National
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Iw04fuUU_400x400.png
END:VEVENT
