DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T213000
UID:260924s-Mv7FirY0K57yznywzpZA
DESCRIPTION:Poetry By The Bay is a free spokenword open mic event in Valle
 jo\, CA. Since 2008 we've welcomed and encouraged artists to express who t
 hey are and grow as a person and an artist in a safe space.\n\nJoin us eve
 ry 4th Thursday of the month at Mira Theatre. Sign the sign up list for ti
 me on the stage.\n\nWe don't know what others will share so be open minded
  and aware that adult content may be discussed.\n\nDonations are appreciat
 ed to help support the forces behind the scenes that make it all possible.
  Enjoy the Show & Keep Writing.
LOCATION:Mira Theatre Guild
URL:http://www.poetrybythebay.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.blindscream.com/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.blindscream.com/"}
