DESCRIPTION:Girls\, dolls\, and allies\, dinner is served.\n\nJoin us on F
 riday\, October 23rd from 6-9pm for a community gathering with \\(girl\\) 
 dinner\, music\, drinks\, and artmaking.\n\nCome with your appetite\, leav
 e with a full belly\, full heart\, and your own original\, framed piece of
  Filipino-food art you beautifully crafted to adorn your walls.\n\nSons of
  Silog will provide a very aesthetic\, very chic set of bites \\(detailed 
 menu to follow\\). Jason Toney of Provisions will be concocting something 
 special. “Fill your plate” - collage plate\, that is - with cutouts of
  Filipino foods \\(rice\, fish\, barbecue\, etc.\\) and accessories \\(sna
 ke eyes\, balisong\, brass knuckles etc.\\). You'll be able to color in al
 l your collage food and accessories and decorate your very own art plate o
 f food. Once complete\, you can frame your work \\(frame provided\\)\, and
  walk home with something beautiful to put up on your walls.\n\nTickets ar
 e $35\, which covers food and water \\(because hydration is cute\\)\, and 
 art activation.\n\nSpace is limited.\n\nSee you there\, darlings.
