SUMMARY:Summer Night City-The ABBA Tribute
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T200000
UID:260914qaUOqAgI-USN7fb8kGXaYw
DESCRIPTION:Step into a world of glitter and glam with Summer Night City\,
  the ultimate ABBA tribute band! Since their formation\, Summer Night City
  has been captivating audiences with their electrifying performances\, pay
 ing homage to the legendary Swedish supergroup that defined a generation.\
 n\nBringing together a group of passionate musicians and performers\, Summ
 er Night City perfectly captures the essence of ABBA with stunning vocal h
 armonies\, authentic costumes\, and an infectious energy that lights up th
 e stage. From timeless classics like "Dancing Queen" and "Mama Mia" to dee
 per cuts that fans adore\, their setlist is a celebration of the hits that
  made ABBA a household name.\n\nWith performances at festivals\, private e
 vents\, and iconic venues\, Summer Night City has quickly become a favorit
 e among ABBA enthusiasts and newcomers alike. Their commitment to authenti
 city\, combined with their vibrant stage presence\, creates an unforgettab
 le experience that transports audiences back to the dazzling disco era.\n\
 nJoin Summer Night City for a night filled with music\, nostalgia\, and pl
 enty of dancing! Whether you're reliving your youth or discovering the mag
 ic of ABBA for the first time\, this tribute band promises to make your ev
 ening truly special. Get ready to sing along and dance the night away—be
 cause with Summer Night City\, every night is a celebration!
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://wl.eventim.us/event/summer-night-city/700069?afflky=MysticThea
 tre2
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
