DESCRIPTION:Expand Your Creative Vision with Your Phone’s Camera Join us
  at JLSP for an inspiring and hands-on exploration of your phone camera’
 s creative potential. During the first half of the class\, we’ll meet in
  the Museum to demonstrate camera settings\, creative features\, and pract
 ical techniques that will help you make the most of the camera you carry e
 very day. Our demonstrations are designed not only to teach you how the ca
 mera works\, but also to inspire your eye for composition\, light\, and st
 orytel
