SUMMARY:Planting Day at Casa Grande High School
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T140000
UID:260922iJ41vMQVrkWr0IK3r7b8zg
DESCRIPTION:Join our Planting Day -- help turn lawns into habitat at Casa
  Grande HS!\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------
 ---------------------------------------------------------------\n\nDaily A
 cts and Casa Grande High School are teaming up to transform grass to garde
 ns in front of the school! This summer we sheet mulched 3 sections of la
 wn and fall is the right time to to get native & climate appropriate pla
 ntings in the ground for winter rains!\n\nTogether\, we’ll create a wa
 ter-wise landscape that will build habitat and bring beauty to the school
  community for years to come.\n\nNOTE: All are welcome \\(including childr
 en with adult supervision\\) and no experience needed\n\nCome for some\,
  or come for all --  we will gather rain or shine!\n\n\\*Register at dai
 lyacts.org/volunteer.\n\n-------------------------------------------------
 --------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nWe
 'll provide:\n\n-FREE Lunch & Snacks\n\n-Instruction & tools\n\n-A fun da
 y with the Petaluma community\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\n\n
 Have questions? Reach out to us anytime by email to jordan@dailyacts.org o
 r by phone at \\(707\\)789-9664
LOCATION:Casa Grande High School
URL:https://volunteer.bloomerang.co/volunteer/#/join-party?k=urwanyvov3cl1
 n
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
