X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://musicinplace.org/event/a-whole-new-world-2/", "Press Democrat": "https://musicinplace.org/event/a-whole-new-world-2/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://musicinplace.org/event/a-whole-new-world-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:A Whole New World – The Disney Songs of Alan Menken
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T153000
UID:260922zxsMka2mNUWr9czcgtvrEw
DESCRIPTION:Discover the unforgettable songs of Alan Menken\, the composer
  whose music has inspired generations to dream bigger\, love deeper\, and 
 find the courage to become who they are. This enchanting cabaret journeys 
 through the remarkable career of the Academy Award-winning composer\, feat
 uring fresh arrangements of beloved favorites from “The Little Mermaid\,
 ” “Beauty and the Beast\,” “Aladdin\,” “Little Shop of Horrors
 \,” “Newsies\,” “The Hunchback of Notre Dame\,” and more.\n\nWov
 en together through stories of imagination\, hope\, and transformation\, t
 hese timeless songs celebrate the extraordinary collaborations that have s
 haped some of the most cherished works of musical theatre and film. Perfor
 med by world-class artists\, this uplifting celebration promises an unforg
 ettable afternoon filled with heart\, humor\, and a little bit of magic.
LOCATION:Sonoma Valley Museum of Art
URL:https://musicinplace.org/event/a-whole-new-world-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
