SUMMARY:Lobster Bash - Sebastopol Rotary Club Fundraiser
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T213000
UID:260830vJNWYLbGIkeFS8hVC9-N6g
DESCRIPTION:Music \\(Sonoma Aroma\\)\, Dinner\, Dancing\, Raffle\, Live an
 d Silent Auctions. Dinner includes a one and a half pound lobster\, shrimp
 \, sausages\, potatoes\, corn\, leeks\, dessert and appetizers. Wine\, bee
 r & cocktails included.\n\nThis is our Rotary club’s major Fundraising e
 vent of our 102nd year. Help to support youth leadership\, scholarship\, a
 nd other educational programs such as Mark Sell Teacher Grants \\(helping 
 teachers enhance their learning curriculum for west county students\\)\, L
 earn to Swim for second graders in West Sonoma County\, Cool Kids Camp for
  physically or emotionally abused children 8-12 years old\, financial lite
 racy programs and much more!! This fundraiser helps to support community p
 rojects\, in addition to youth programs\, such as the 2024 rebuilding of t
 he Willard Libby Park duck pond fence.\n\nSebastopol Rotary puts the fun i
 n fundraising.\n\nCall Cindy Carter at 408-431-7820 to answers any questio
 ns you may have\, reserve a ticket or table for 8. Or\, go to our website:
