BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/marc-cary-trio/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Marc Cary Trio
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T210000
UID:260715b8gYJz-L2EagC3BUsv5gFA
DESCRIPTION:In a jazz world brimming with brilliant and adventurous pianis
 ts\, Marc Cary stands apart by way of pedigree and design as one of New Yo
 rk's best jazz pianists. With his Focus Trio\, Cary strikes an organic bal
 ance between jazz harmonies and rhythms from Africa and India. Drummer and
  tabla player Sameer Gupta plays an essential role in these rhythms along 
 with bassist David Ewell\, who are the original members of the Focus Trio 
 and collaborators for over 20 years. Grammy-nominated pianist Cary brings 
 into sharp focus his many influences-from deep indigenous world rhythms to
  hard bop to classical lyricism. The energy and the cultural wealth of Har
 lem\, New York resonate in their music. Cary is alternately percussive and
  subtle\, animated and introspective\, balancing energy and lyricism with 
 a depth of personal expression that which he calls "classical indigenous j
 azz for the people." Cary's mission statement for Focus is "to bring indig
 enous rhythms together with American jazz to create new palettes of sound.
 "
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/marc-cary-trio/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.blindscream.com/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.blindscream.com/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.blindscream.com/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Blind Scream Haunted House
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T220000
UID:2609216lVYpuOkMUO5OqC9EIUgXQ
DESCRIPTION:Open 13 nights only\, join the Doc and his family and step int
 o over 20\,000 square feet of haunted horror in the heart of Santa Rosa. T
 his year we have 2 distinct haunts for you to sink your teeth into.\n\nBli
 nd Scream Haunted House features the all new Caverns of Carnage where wind
 ing tunnels\, claustrophobic chambers\, and forgotten caverns have danger 
 lurking around every corner. The deeper you go\, the harder it becomes to 
 tell what’s part of the cave and what’s watching you from within it.\n
 \nBLACKOUT Haunted House is a pitch-black maze. All you have to guide your
  way is one glow stick… and the creatures stalking your every step. Ever
 y sense will be tested. Every turn is a challenge. And one wrong move… t
 he scream is yours.\n\nFeed your terrors today and get your tickets before
  it's too late. Once the 13 nights are gone\, the haunt disappears until n
 ext year!\n\nLocation - 98 Santa Rosa Plaza\, Downtown Santa Rosa \\(at th
 e corners of 1st Street and A Street\\). South of the Santa Rosa Plaza par
 king garage.
LOCATION:Blind Scream Haunted House
URL:https://www.blindscream.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
