SUMMARY:Wine Dinner with Jeff Bundschu (Kansas City)
DESCRIPTION:Gundlach Bundschu Wine Dinner with Jeff Bundschu\nThursday\, October 29 | The Restaurant at 1900 | Mission Woods\, KS \nGreat wine\, great food\, and a little music. Join Jeff Bundschu for an intimate evening in The Restaurant at 1900’s Modern Culinary space\, featuring Gundlach Bundschu wines paired with Chef Linda Duerr’s cuisine and music selected to accompany the evening. \nWith six generations of family history behind every pour\, Jeff will bring a taste of Rhinefarm to the communal table. Pull up a chair and settle in for a memorable night of Sonoma wine and warm hospitality. \nArrive between 5:30 and 6 p.m. for drinks. Dinner begins promptly at 6 p.m.\nSeating is limited and communal. Please contact the restaurant before booking to discuss any dietary restrictions. \nReserve Your Seat
