DESCRIPTION:Come and view our closest star and learn about sunspots\, prom
 inences\, flares and more. We observe with both visible light and radio te
 lescopes. Sign up for this free event at <a href="https://www.google.com/
 url?q=https://rfo.simpletix.com&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=17
