SUMMARY:Mark West Area Chamber of Commerce Monthly Social
DESCRIPTION:When: Thursday\, November 12 \nTime: 5:30 PM – 7:30 PM \nWhere: Anytime Fitness Larkfield | 620 Larkfield Center Santa Rosa\, CA 95403 \nFree Attendance: We warmly invite the community to join us for FREE to network while enjoying food and beverages provided by our host. \n\n\nWhy You Should Attend? \n\n\n\n\nGather Insights: Learn firsthand from fellow attendees about trends\, opportunities\, and challenges that affect our local economy and businesses. \nExpand Your Circle: Connect with professionals across industries in a relaxed and welcoming environment. \nInspiring Conversations: Get involved in meaningful discussions and leave each luncheon feeling inspired and motivated. \nMark Your Calendar\, Invite a Friend & Join Us!  \nEvery month brings new opportunities to bring businesses and the greater community together to connect. \nPlease invite a friend to join us so they too can see how the Mark West Area Chamber can help promote their business!
