 ce of artwork.\n\nYou can expect a mix of practical tips\, upbeat encoura
 gement and a little entertainment that will help you break through mental
  barriers and hesitations!\n\n\nTo register\, please email Ann at: annde_
 2@yahoo.com mailto:annde_2@yahoo.com or call/ text her at 707-548-6499
