 rhood while creating opportunities for academic\, personal\, and professio
 nal development.  Topics may include:Academic success and study strategies
   Brotherhood &amp\; community  Personal development  Mental health &amp\;
  wellness  Career and life skills  Leadership and mentorship  For more inf
 ormation\, visit the Sawubona BLOC website. (https://bloc.santarosa.edu/au
 gust-2026)  The Sawubona BLOC is located in Pioneer Hall\, Room 360 (next 
 to the bookstore) on the Santa Rosa Campus.
