X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar Livewhale": "https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23554-beautiful-trash-exhibit"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_livewhale
SUMMARY:Beautiful TRASH Exhibit
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261209
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261210
DTSTAMP:20260820T143514Z
UID:20261209T080000Z-23554@calendar.santarosa.edu
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20261209
ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/src_region/0,0,846,846/684_Beautiful_Trash_SRJC_Art_Exhibit_2.rev.1
 787262058.png
CATEGORIES:Arts,Department Events
DESCRIPTION:The Beautiful TRASH exhibit features artworks from six student
 s who participated in a seven-week art residency program.  The students se
 lected trash from Recology's Materials Recovery Facility and created art t
 hat inspires reflection on our habits with waste.  TRASH (The Recology Art
 start Student Hub) is a collaboration between Recology Sonoma Marin and Ar
 tstart.  This event is an SRJC Libraries collaboration with Recology Sonom
 a Marin and Artstart.  &#160\;For more information about the Herold Mahone
