DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
DTSTAMP:20261002T230420
CREATED:20260917T011601Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260917T011601Z
UID:10000425-1796947200-1797033599@ranchonicasio.com
SUMMARY:STELLA HEATH XMAS SHOW (Billie Holiday/ Ella Fitzgerald Tribute feat. Stella Heath)
DESCRIPTION:THE STELLA HEATH CHRISTMAS SHOW – Billie Holiday/ Ella Fitzgerald Tribute!\n \n\nThis special performance will be a heartfelt homage to ELLA FITZGERALD the First Lady of Song\, blending her timeless music with fascinating historical stories and meticulous research.\nStella and her quintet will also present the music of BILLIE HOLIDAY. Shrouded in mystery as she was draped in fur\, Billie was multi-faceted; she possessed a sensitivity and ability to make the songs she sang as personal as if she was singing them softly in your very own ear. Featuring some of the Bay Area’s finest Jazz musicians\, Stella’s quintet brings back the electric and intimate feeling of seeing Lady Day live in a 1930’s Jazz Club.
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/stella-heath-xmas-show-billie-holiday-ella-fitzgerald-tribute-feat-stella-heath-2/
LOCATION:Rancho Nicasio\, 1 Old Rancheria Rd\, Nicasio\, CA\, 94946\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ranchonicasio.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Stella-Heath-Resized-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
