 ies. Experience the colorful costumes\, cultural traditions\, distinct dan
 ces\, and live music from Jalisco\, Sinaloa\, Oaxaca\, Michoacán\, and no
 w from Baja Norte and Chihuahua. Artistic Director\, Steven Valencia and t
 he Calidanza Dance Company\, with musicians from Vinic Kay\, once again we
 lcome you to enjoy this visually stunning\, joyful holiday celebration. ¡
 Feliz Na
