CREATED:20260429T174738Z
DESCRIPTION:Sips and Stars ~ an evening of fine wine and cosmic wonder.\n\
 nJoin us for a magical night under the stars at the Robert Ferguson Observ
 atory! Our Sips & Stars event blends the beauty of the night sky with the 
 elegance of Sonoma County wine. Enjoy a curated tasting experience hosted 
 by Burtech Family Vineyard\,  while taking in breathtaking views of the c
 osmos through our powerful telescopes.\n\nAs twilight falls\, relax with a
  glass of wine in hand and listen to engaging astronomy talks from our kno
 wledgeable docents. Once darkness settles\, step up to the observatory’s
  telescopes for guided viewing of planets\, star clusters\, and distant ga
 laxies.\n\nWhether you’re a wine lover\, stargazer\, or simply looking f
 or a unique evening out in Sonoma Valley\, Sips & Stars promises an unforg
 ettable experience where earthly pleasures meet celestial beauty.\n\nGuest
 s must be 21 or older to attend and each registration includes two drink t
 ickets. Proceeds support the Robert Ferguson Observatory’s public educat
 ion programs.\n\nSpace is limited - register at rfo.simpletix.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20260429T174738Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Robert Ferguson Observatory
END:VEVENT
